MODULE: ResolvedMutableCheckpointOwner
TARGET: CacheOwned
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: Mutated live checkpoint binding changes cache ownership while the original tail still runs
PERTURBS: PublishCheckpoint

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<tail,owner,resolved,order,prepared,terminal,stagedOwner,
        read,heads,projections,candidate,capturedHead>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ owner' = liveBinding'
    /\ UNCHANGED <<tail,resolved,order,prepared,terminal,stagedOwner,
        read,heads,projections,candidate,capturedHead>>
--- END
